WEBVTT

00:10:58.667 --> 00:11:00.476
but to actually feel pride --

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:02.518
and those of you who have felt it know --

00:11:02.542 --> 00:11:06.851
it's like you just want to like,
touch everybody and grab and run around.

00:11:06.875 --> 00:11:08.351
It's like a very --

00:11:08.375 --> 00:11:09.643
I can't explain --

00:11:09.667 --> 00:11:11.351
it's just a very physical feeling,

00:11:11.375 --> 00:11:15.292
all because of
a long pattern of connection.

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:18.726
Film was a gift given to me,

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:21.434
and through the years
I've learned a lot of things.

00:11:21.458 --> 00:11:24.601
You can plan, you can write scripts,
you can do your storyboards,

00:11:24.625 --> 00:11:26.851
but at a certain point,

00:11:26.875 --> 00:11:29.018
your movie will speak back to you,

00:11:29.042 --> 00:11:31.208
and it's your job to listen.